    "b-50-knowledge-model-runtime-knowledge-source-2": {
      "id": "b-50-knowledge-model-runtime-knowledge-source-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Runtime knowledge sources, tools, resource graph, agent context, and PR evidence."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-50-knowledge-model-runtime-knowledge-is-pla-3": {
      "id": "b-50-knowledge-model-runtime-knowledge-is-pla-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Runtime knowledge is platform-owned evidence selected or searched by agents. It\nis not a Codex skill. The model separates access modes: injected context,\nindependently searchable knowledge bases, code-connected evidence,\ngraph-owned mutable state, callable operations, and role behavior. Knowledge\nsources provide facts and corpora. Toolpacks provide reusable operations. The\nselected project owns checkout-derived graph facts, tool bindings, tool data,\nand run evidence, while agent system prompts plus routed worker context own\nrole behavior."
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-50-knowledge-model-knowledge-types-4": {
      "id": "b-50-knowledge-model-knowledge-types-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Knowledge Types"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-50-knowledge-model-type-purpose-5": {
      "id": "b-50-knowledge-model-type-purpose-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "| Type | Purpose |\n| --- | --- |\n| Injected context | Compact source slices selected before or during worker boot: global "
        },
        {
          "insert": "decomp_standards",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", path-scoped "
        },
        {
          "insert": "path_facts",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and the maintainer-rejection record "
        },
        {
          "insert": "banned_patterns",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " |\n| Searchable knowledge bases | RAG-style corpora that agents query on demand, such as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "powerpc_docs",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "; these support lexical JSONL lookup and source-local semantic vector lookup after vectorization |\n| Code-connected evidence | Source slices that link to files, symbols, PRs, file cards, graph hits, or rank features |\n| Deprecated knowledge slices | Archived lookup slices such as "
        },
        {
          "insert": "discord_knowledge",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", "
        },
        {
          "insert": "ssbm_data_sheet",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": ", and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "external_mirrors",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "; these are retained for manual investigation or explicit profile overrides, not default worker browsing |\n| Tools | Toolpack-defined callable operations for lookup, validation, compiler diagnosis, source editing, data conversion, and operator maintenance; project bindings choose implementation overrides, shared data roots, and worktree cache roots |\n| Code graph | Current-checkout facts about files, object units, functions, match status, and editability |\n| Resource graph | Project-selected SQLite graph state linking the code graph with global PR history, source hits, durable lessons, mismatch patterns, editability, and rank features |\n| Agent context | Compact worker guidance selected by "
        },
        {
          "insert": "apps/server/src/core/agent-catalog/context/manifest.json",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "; scheduler policy lives in deterministic runtime code |\n| Graph enrichments | Durable learned facts, such as imported legacy shared-agent lessons, curator-produced worker/PR lessons, and derived mismatch-pattern entities, stored as graph-owned artifacts |"
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    "b-50-knowledge-model-selection-6": {
      "id": "b-50-knowledge-model-selection-6",
