      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "When adding evidence, decide whether it is injected context, a searchable source,\ncode-connected evidence, a tool, graph enrichment, durable mismatch-pattern\nknowledge, or a past-PR artifact. Raw run output remains evidence until it is\ncurated into a durable graph record. When\nadding behavior, put it beside the agent as context and route it through\n"
        },
        {
          "insert": "apps/server/src/core/agent-catalog/context/manifest.json",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "."
